'''Warped Tortoises''' are creatures found in the [[Poison Waste Dungeon]] beneath the [[Galarpos Mountains]], requiring partial completion of [[The Path of Glouphrie]] and level 56 [[Slayer]] to kill. Players must have the [[crystal chime]] in their inventory to fight them, otherwise they will be invulnerable.

